silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_6_P_C_#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode6 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode6 is the set of vet records of type C observed for Mittens, concretely the second-week body-mass and ownership records at visit_2. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P(C)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
